WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
The Clip-launch layout works like Ableton Live: a grid of clips, scenes and the arrangement.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.200
This is LYNX's demo song. Its sections: Intro, Verse and Chorus.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.800
Right-click a slot and choose Create scenes from sections.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Each section is now a scene, with every track's clip in it.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.400
Click a scene's launch button: its clips start together.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.800
Launch the next scene. It takes over at the next bar.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Click one clip to launch just that track.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.600
The Device view, Ctrl+Alt+4, shows the track's devices.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.000
Song shows the arrangement. Both shows the grid and the arrangement together.
